Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.44,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,677)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:30 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let Yoshikage know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Reimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Rohan, did you take\Nthe pictures in this album?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume there's a reason\Nthis one is marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so special about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to have homed\Nin on this little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not too concerned with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seemed to be sneaking around the\Narea so I thought I'd document him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look, the boy's\Nname is Hayato Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the same surname as this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? He does? Yeah. Check it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.47,0:00:42.98,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Kawajiri Hayato, Kawajiri Kosaku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you investigating this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was one of many potential suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Rohan Kishibe uncovers the truth,\Nit's over for my darling Yoshikage!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.61,0:00:52.65,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,785)\clip(m 686 743 l 692 737 696 731 701 723 708 715 713 708 719 700 724 690 727 688 731 681 732 677 734 675 736 671 741 665 745 660 747 655 752 649 757 643 758 639 762 634 763 631 768 624 772 620 778 610 779 606 782 602 788 596 792 587 797 581 798 578 800 574 804 569 808 562 815 552 818 548 821 544 822 541 828 527 42 371 38 850 583 832)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:48 PM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.65,0:00:52.69,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,785)\clip(m 1319 785 l 1325 779 1329 773 1334 765 1341 757 1346 750 1352 742 1357 732 1360 730 1364 723 1365 719 1367 717 1369 713 1374 707 1378 702 1380 697 1385 691 1390 685 1391 681 1395 676 1396 673 1401 666 1405 662 1411 652 1412 648 1415 644 1421 638 1425 629 1430 623 1431 620 1433 616 1437 611 1441 604 1448 594 1451 590 1454 586 1455 583 1461 569 42 371 38 850 1216 874)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:48 PM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.69,0:00:54.95,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,927)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:48 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last time I'll say it, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me when I call you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn it\Nwas Hayato in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, what are we\Ngoing to do with that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His clothes are scattered around\Nthe hallway like a bomb went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish he'd take after\Nyou a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could be such a slob.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention he's ignoring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though if I know him, he's probably\Nreading manga with his headphones on again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.44,0:01:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got blood on your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want it to get infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll take care of it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a simple bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just caught my fingers in the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal, really.
