Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.64,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,550)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:50 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato Kawajiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think this grade school\Nkid has something to do with Kira?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.06,0:03:36.52,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 35: {\fs80} Another One Bites the Dust, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.06,0:03:36.52,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 35: {\fs80} Another One Bites the Dust Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at this point, we're not\Ntotally sure if they're connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, Rohan-sensei\Nthinks he's onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A grade school kid taking\Nvideos of his dad on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the down low sends up\Nsome serious red flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're talking about meeting\Nup tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we've gone through everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll head over to Hayato\NKawajiri's house together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei said he's already\Nfigured out the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That artsy asshole doesn't\Nmiss a beat, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I should ask Okuyasu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Jotaro, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave getting in touch with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll see you\Ntomorrow at 8.30 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look for the big Pepsi sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepsi at 8.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I'm gonna be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, if things pan out the way Rohan\Nhopes, it'll be worth the tardy slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell there's\Nsomething wrong, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all pale and sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just in some pain is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did just slam my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please, go downstairs\Nand make some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is gonna sound totally\Nrandom, but well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've had this vibe\Nlike you'll live forever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tea will be ready soon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as lay a single\Nfinger on me your whole cover
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be blown sky-high Stay the\Nhell away from me and my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's non-negotiable, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away or I reveal everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're adorably naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I'd let someone find me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting rid of that Hayato brat\Nwas the very height of foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You of all people should have known that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, I'm trying to think\Nof a way out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste time, it's\Ntoo late for that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a remarkable job of making it\Nlook as though he fell and hit his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your timing really\Ncouldn't have been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:06:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe has already begun his\Ninvestigation into Hayato Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know for sure yet that\NKosaku Kawajiri is Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're coming here tomorrow\Nto find out once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanyu mustn't remain in\Nthis house a minute longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when you were a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when things didn't go your way and\Nyou felt the world was against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd always bite your nails\Ntill your fingers were raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poor sweet boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the misery you must be suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've run out of options here, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave this wretched\Ntown behind for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get out now, you still have a chance\Nto escape and hold on to your anonymity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously asking me to\Nrun away and abandon Morioh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living every moment in\Nexcruciating secrecy is one of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the most horrible experiences\Na person can go through,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I refuse to go back to that hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I will never leave this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arrow moved on its own, but\NI swear I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even touching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Yoshikage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiato! Hiato!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.07,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\pos(960,785)}July 16th (Friday) 7:30 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how long are you gonna sleep in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato, why didn't you tell\Nme you were out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come down for breakfast\Nand answer when I call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a terrible night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That jerk-faced imposter found out I\Nwitnessed one of his murders and assaulted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I've made sure he can't\Ndo anything to hurt me or mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's a temporary solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find a way around that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world's gotten\Ninto you, Yoshikage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been acting\Nstrange since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but Rohan Kishibe is now\Nkeen on snooping around Hayato Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've run out of time, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming to search\Nthe house tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no cause for alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Yoshikage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My deadly queen has\Nacquired a third ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could have happened to make you\Nso lackadaisical all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miso-marinated cow tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say we were on the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 7.55.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for today's\Nprefectural weather report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be enjoying\Nsunny skies. Hi-ya, Toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His attitude has completely\Nchanged since that bath last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened between now and then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn phone isn't gonna\Nanswer itself, you know!
