Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.33,0:10:08.37,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=1}{\bord9.96\fscx109.57\fscy99.61\fade(255,0,255,-870,-870,-110,40)\frz16.55\pos(829.5,412.01)}S{*\c&H5267EF&}h{*\c&H4E5FEF&}a{*\c&H4B58F0&}t{*\c&H4850F0&}t{*\c&H4448F0&}e{\c&H4140F0&}r
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My favorite China tea set!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you ignore me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any\Nrespect for your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only see me as a\Nnuisance who gets in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fine! I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not start the day with an argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it can't be fixed,\NI'll buy you another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Kawajiri residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the wrong number, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Hayato's going through a quiet phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should support each other,\Nnot tear each other down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all work on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of work, I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I head off,\NI'd like to steal a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God, he took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we walk together for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One moment I'm in the throes of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm on top of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much has happened so very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been an absolute\Nwhirlwind of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, at long last, I'll be able to\Nlive a life free of worry and anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really put the pressure on last\Nnight, but because of you, I've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so extraordinarily determined,\Nespecially for a tank your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible that you\Nthreatened Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I just told you my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean you're\Ngoing to kill me after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply because you know my secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what\Nyou or anyone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one in the world can rival me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You no longer arouse any interest in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I wanted to kill you, I would\Nhave simply finished the job last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all going to get along\Njust fine, I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So take a breath, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Daddy Dearest is off to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your best at school today, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can rival him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means there must be\Nother people walking around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out there with the same\Nkind of bizarre powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, his confidence is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's brazenly calling\Nhimself unrivaled now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he gained some new power?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I'm supposed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're Hayato Kawajiri. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
