Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Rohan Kishibe, and\NI have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do us both a favor and answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you were taking a video of\Nyour dad in the back there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that was unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Questioning him would be troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reading his mind will be much more\Nefficient when it comes to this endeavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention it'll be far\Nmore accurate than a Q A?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.28,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: [WARNING] Do not read any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would that be in his pages?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing Heaven's Door\Nshould be revealing is a candid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honest, written account of this boy's\Nlife memories And yet, there's a warning?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.42,0:14:25.17,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: [WARNING] Do not read any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This warning here, is it part\Nof the boy's life experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I drove over today, I wasn't planning\Non giving him more than a quick peruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now he's got me strangely hooked.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.44,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: [WARNING] Do not read any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not read on. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who that could be for.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.11,0:14:47.49,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: An old man walked by with his fly down.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.41,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: He sneezed and said, "Dammit."
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.41,0:14:51.82,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Two women laughed at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes even less sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid who the hell is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.47,0:15:11.76,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: It rained.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on the weather report\Nnever said anything about rain
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.36,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: At 8:27 AM, lightning struck above the Pepsi sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, a 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this Hayato Kawajiri, and\Nhow does he experience the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he be a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way this is a stand ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Door can't read the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just reveals what\None has seen and heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.98,0:15:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain the explanation would\Nbe somewhere in these pages.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.31,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: My Papa isn't my Papa.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.02,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: He blew up a man and a woman in an apartment in Zyouzenji.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.02,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: He blew up a man and a woman in an apartment in Jozenji.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.02,0:16:04.52,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: He's a murderer. I know who he is. He has inhuman abilities.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.02,0:16:08.03,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: My Papa's name is Kira Yoshikage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little kid, he's a jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira is Kosaku Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disguised himself as this kid's father.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.30,0:16:32.63,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Kishi
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.63,0:16:32.97,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.97,0:16:33.30,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Ro
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.30,0:16:33.63,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,ha
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.63,0:16:33.97,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,n
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.97,0:16:34.30,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,was
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.30,0:16:34.64,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,then
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.64,0:16:34.97,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,mur
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.97,0:16:35.30,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,der
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.30,0:16:35.76,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Rohan Kishibe was also killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new super-powered Kira\Nfound a way to murder him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen bomb type 3 bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen has already\Nentered your pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen's bomb type 3\Nhas already been activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time is come?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen's new power will annihilate\Nall who attempt to take me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bomb that will activate in anyone\Nwho dares approach Hayato to get to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.11,0:17:40.12,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)}Note: Kishibe Rohan was then murdered. \NBecause Kira had matured, he murdered him.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.11,0:17:40.12,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)}Note: Kishibe Rohan was then murdered. \NBecause Kira had grown stronger, he murdered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato's verbalizing my true\Nname will also activate the bomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as will putting my name in writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, my new bomb\Nhas been planted in Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised to meet Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and the others will be here at 8.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rooted out Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know who he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let him know. I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira is Kosaku Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evan's door sniffed him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, gaze upon the glory\Nthat is Nedley Queen Bob-type 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a terrible night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was one horrible dream\Nafter another. Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how long are you gonna sleep in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato, why didn't you tell\Nme you were out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come down for breakfast\Nand answer when I call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say we were on...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've seen this newscast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of what just happened was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is repeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I'm reliving the\Nsame morning from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that guy's real\Nname is Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what he meant by being unrivaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done something to\Nme with his new power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn phone isn't going\Nto answer itself, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.14,0:20:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice catch, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like you knew\NI was going to drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you could try answering me next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kawajiri residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm the only one who knows\Nthis morning already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for everyone else,\Nit's business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you knew she\Nwas going to drop it, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears you've returned from a long day\Nof blasting your friend to kingdom come,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truthfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not actually privy to all the gory\Ndetails of your little foray today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Deadly Queen's new power\Nis called Bites the Dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It automatically protects me\Nfrom right inside your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thank you, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you even aware that I killed\Nyou last night when we were in the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, it was as if the fates\Nthemselves had witnessed my despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was granted a gift in\Nthe form of this ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried the ability out on you, and\Nmiraculously time reversed course one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reality that I'd\Nmurdered you was no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time, you also became\Nmy personal life-protecting bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told one of them about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thereby activating the bomb\Nand sending you back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, who did you annihilate, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did you murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell anyone anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not, which tells me you were\Ninterrogated by Rohan Kishibe, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you never think about tattling,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a simple inquiry into the\Nidentity of yours truly will
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be enough to activate the\Nhorrors of Bites the Dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After which, you'll incinerate\Nthe offender and zip back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your visit with Rohan Kishibe is\Nnow a figment of your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now you know the\Npower it bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My true name will never cross your lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no soul will live long\Nenough to seek me out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.80,0:22:52.18,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.18,0:22:54.43,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.43,0:22:57.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.23,0:22:58.89,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.89,0:23:01.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.65,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.65,0:23:06.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.44,0:23:08.15,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come and stand a little bit\Ncloser, breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.15,0:23:10.41,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.41,0:23:12.74,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.74,0:23:14.37,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.37,0:23:17.00,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.00,0:23:21.50,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I\Nneed you, but ooh, I gotta find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.50,0:23:25.05,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.05,0:23:30.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.83,0:23:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you, I don't know if I need\Nyou, but ooh, I gotta find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.51,0:23:33.89,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll break it down.
